   "record": "8d4606541b5c7720609939001fdb521b18bb9e1b312eba04cd4ac17ca1cbbac4",
   "status": "MISMATCH",
   "ruling": "Ruling: scope; i1040sc, Line 20a: \"But if you leased a vehicle for a term of 30 days or more, you may have to reduce your deduction by the inclusion amount\", as the earlier rulings. An inclusion amount for leased property is refused for the business: sc.special lists \"recapture of depreciation or section 179 on listed property, ... or an inclusion amount for leased property\", and sc.screened (which reads sc.special) refuses Schedule C line 1 (forms/2025/sc.yaml). So line 20a is the business portion of the lease payments on every vehicle that reaches it. Project stands.",
   "subject_key": "f24e39bd212fc31ce0caacac49bfb61a29d28b79e5b5d4da0f5a5f2f7937498c"
  },
  {
   "key": "(b)",
